# Cline adapter

Start with AGENTS.md. Read docs/engineering-rules.md for shared policy and only
applicable sections of docs/dev-rules.md. Use docs/architecture.md and docs/testing.md
for navigation and verification. No separate edit allowlist overrides task scope.

For local-model continuity, keep gitignored TASK_NOTES.md under 40 lines with Goal,
Done, Facts, Next and Open questions. Record verified paths and unresolved uncertainty;
trust source over notes. After compaction read it before resuming. At completion set
it to "No active task." Use the matching docs/recipes/ recipe for routine settings,
module, slash-command or API work. Read large files by symbol and targeted ranges.
